{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17110","headline":"白露爲霜 · 颜粲","name":"白露爲霜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悲秋将岁晚，繁露已成霜。\n徧渚芦先白，沾篱菊自黄。\n应钟鸣远寺，拥雁度三湘。\n气逼襦衣薄，寒侵宵梦长。\n满庭添月色，拂水敛荷香。\n独念蓬门下，穷年在一方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜粲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}